								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div><h4>Enjoy a Christmas rewind from 2025</h4>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Watch the magic of donor generosity delivered to more than 5,000</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"> children and seniors in Central Virginia.</span>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q0a-5eumvGM?si=tG9ZoCYgMhIDUMu-\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tFollowing a final internal reconciliation, the confirmed total served through Angel Tree this season is <strong>5,035—about an 8% increase over last year.</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-fluid rounded d-block mx-auto\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/5131a085-ade8-4e52-b6db-5b52ba1e6f1f_2025+Angel+Tree+Highlights+FINAL.png\" style=\"width:431px;height:332.75px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n<p>\n\t<img class=\"img-fluid rounded d-block mx-auto\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/151f883e-336c-4fae-9599-faf5c8ae1d72_FINAL+RTD+2025+TY+AD.png\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t \n</p></div></div>",
